hadiths[24]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1151","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Ae Musalman auraton! Padosan padosan key liye (tohfa) haqeer na samjhey agarchey bakri ka khur ho. (Bukhari: 2566)"
"1152","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Urwa se kaha: Ae merey bhatijay! Beshak ham chaand phir chaand dekhtey they, do mahinon mein teen chaand, jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key gharon mein aag na jalaai jaati thi. To main ne kaha: Ae khaala! Tumhey kya zinda rakhta tha? Unhon-ne kaha: Do kaaley, khajoor aur paani. Magar ye ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key Ansaar mein se padosi they jinkey paas doodh denay waley jaanwar they. Aur wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko unkey doodhon mein se aariyat detey aur hamein pilaatey. (Bukhari: 2567)"
"1153","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Agar mujhey dasta ya paya ki daawat di jaey to qabool karunga. Aur agar mujhey dasta ya paya tohfey mein diya jaey to qabool karunga. (Bukhari: 2568)"
"1154","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham ne Marr-uz-Zahraan mein khargosh daudaaya. To qaum daudi aur thak gai. To main ne use paa liya aur pakad liya. To main use Abu Talha key paas laaya. To unhon-ne use zibah kya aur use Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf uski raan ya uski donon raanein bhejin. To Aap ne use qabool kya. Main ne kaha: Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Aur us mein se khaaya. (Bukhari: 2572)"
"1155","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ibn Abbas ki khaala Umm Hufaid ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko paneer aur ghee aur goh tohfey mein diye. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne paneer aur ghee mein se khaaya aur goh ko naapasand kar key chhor diya. Ibn Abbas ne kaha: To wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key dastarkhwaan par khaai gai. Aur agar wo haraam hoti to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key dastarkhwaan par na khaai jaati. (Bukhari: 2575)"
"1156","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab khaana laaya jaata to uskey baarey mein poochhtey: Kya tohfa hai ya sadqa? Phir agar kaha jaata: Sadqa hai, to Aap apne sahaaba se kehtey: Khaao, aur na khaatey. Aur agar kaha jaata: Tohfa hai, to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apna haath maartey aur unkey sath khaatey."
"1157","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas gosht laaya gaya. To kaha gaya: Barira ko sadqey mein diya gaya tha. Aap ne farmaya: Wo uskey liye sadqa hai aur hamaarey liye tohfa hai. (Bukhari: 2577)"
"1158","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki biwiyaan do girohon mein thein. To aik giroh mein Aisha aur Hafsa aur Safiya aur Sauda thein. Aur doosra giroh Umm Salma aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki baaqi biwiyaan thein. Aur Musalman jaan chukey they ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Aisha se mohabbat kartey hain. Phir jab un mein se kisi key paas tohfa hota jo wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko tohfey mein dena chaahta to use moakkhar karta yahan tak ke jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Aisha key ghar mein hotey to tohfey wala use Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf Aisha key ghar mein bhejta. To Umm Salma waley giroh ne baat ki aur unhon-ne un se kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se baat karo, wo logon se kahein aur farmaaen: Jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko tohfa dena chaahe to use unhey tohfey mein dey jahaan wo unki biwiyon key gharon mein hon. To Umm Salma ne un se jo unhon-ne kaha tha baat ki. To Aap ne un se kuchh na kaha. To unhon-ne un se poochha. To unhon-ne kaha: Aap ne mujh se kuchh nahi kaha. To unhon-ne un se kaha: Un se baat karo. Unhon-ne kaha: To unhon-ne un se baat ki jab Aap unki taraf phir aey. To Aap ne un se kuchh na kaha. To unhon-ne un se poochha. To unhon-ne kaha: Aap ne mujh se kuchh nahi kaha. To unhon-ne un se kaha: Un se baat karo yahan tak ke wo tum se baat karein. To Aap unki taraf aey aur unhon-ne Aap se baat ki. To Aap ne un se farmaya: Mujhey Aisha key baarey mein takleef na do. Beshak wahi Aap par na aai jabke main aurat key kapdey mein hun, Aisha key siwa. Unhon-ne kaha: To unhon-ne kaha: Main Ya Rasulullah tumhey takleef deney se Allah ki taraf tauba karti hun. Phir unhon-ne Faatima bint Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko bulaaya. To Aap ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf bhej kar kaha: Beshak tumhaari biwiyaan tum se Abu Bakr ki beti key baarey mein insaaf chaahteen hain. To us ne Aap se baat ki. To Aap ne farmaya: Ae meri beti! Kya tum us se mohabbat nahi rakhten jo main pasand karta hun? Us ne kaha: Kyun nahi. To wo unki taraf wapas aaein aur unhey khabar di. To unhon-ne kaha: Unki taraf wapas jao. To us ne wapas jaaney se inkaar kar diya. To unhon-ne Zainab bint Jahsh ko bheja. To wo Aap key paas aaein aur sakhti ki aur kaha: Beshak tumhaari biwiyaan tum se Ibn Abi Quhaafa ki beti key baarey mein Allah ka waasta dey kar insaaf chaahteen hain. To us ne apni aawaaz buland ki yahan tak ke Aisha ko haath lagaa liya jabke wo baithi hui thein. To us ne use bura kaha yahan tak ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Aisha ki taraf dekh rahey they ke kya wo baat karti hain. Unhon-ne kaha: To Aisha ne baat ki aur Zainab ka jawaab deti rahi yahan tak ke use khaamosh kar diya. Unhon-ne kaha: To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Aisha ki taraf dekha aur farmaya: Beshak wo Abu Bakr ki beti hai. (Bukhari: 2581)"
"1159","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khushbu wapas na kartey they. (Bukhari: 2582)"
"1160","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tohfa qabool kartey aur us par badla detey they. (Bukhari: 2585)"
"1161","[AI-translation] Noman bin Basheer (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Merey waalid ne mujhey atiya diya. To Amra bint Rawaaha ne kaha: Main raazi na hungi yahan tak ke tum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko gawaah banao. To wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aey aur unhon-ne kaha: Beshak main ne apne betey ko Amra bint Rawaaha se atiya diya hai. To us ne mujhey hukm diya ke main tumhey gawaah banaaun Ya Rasulullah! Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum ne apney baaqi beton ko us jaisa diya hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Nahi. Aap ne farmaya: To Allah se daro aur apney beton key darmiyaan insaaf karo. Unhon-ne kaha: To wo wapas gaya aur apna atiya wapas kar liya. (Bukhari: 2587)"
"1162","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Apne tohfey mein wapas aaney wala kuttey jaisa hai jo qay karta hai phir apni qay mein wapas aata hai. (Bukhari: 2589)"
"1163","[AI-translation] Maimoona bint Haaris (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne londi aazaad ki aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ijazat na maangi. Phir jab unka din tha jo un par daur kar key aata tha to unhon-ne kaha: Kya tumhey maloom hai Ya Rasulullah ke main ne apni londi aazaad kar di hai? Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum ne kya? Unhon-ne kaha: Haan. Aap ne farmaya: Khabardaar! Beshak agar tum use apne khaaluon ko detin to tumharey ajr key liye bada hota."
"1164","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab safar ka iraada kartey to apni biwiyon key darmiyaan qura andaazi kartey. To jinki qura nikalti unhey apne sath ley jaatey. Aur Aap un mein se har aurat key liye uska din aur uski raat taqseem kartey. Magar ye ke Sauda bint Zamaa ne apna din aur apni raat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki biwi Aisha ko de di, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki raza chaahtey huey."
"1165","[AI-translation] Miswar bin Makhrama (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne qubaaen taqseem kein aur Makhrama ko un mein se kuchh na diya. To Makhrama ne kaha: Ae merey betey! Hamarey sath Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf chalo. To main uskey sath gaya. To us ne kaha: Daakhil ho aur use merey liye bulaao. Unhon-ne kaha: To main ne use uskey liye bulaaya. To wo uski taraf nikley jabke Aap par un mein se qubaa tha. To Aap ne farmaya: Main ne ye tumharey liye chhupaaya hai. Unhon-ne kaha: To us ne uski taraf dekha aur farmaya: Makhrama raazi hua. (Bukhari: 2599)"
"1166","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Faatima key ghar tashreef laaey aur uskey paas daakhil na huey. Aur Ali aey aur us ne un se uska zikr kya. To unhon-ne uska Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se zikr kya. Aap ne farmaya: Beshak main ne uskey darwaazey par naqshdaar parda dekha hai. To Aap ne farmaya: Mujhey duniya se kya kaam. To Ali uskey paas aey aur us se uska zikr kya. To us ne kaha: Wo uskey baarey mein jo chaahe hukm dein. Aap ne farmaya: Use fulaan key paas bhej do, ghar waley jinhey haajat hai. (Bukhari: 2613)"
"1167","[AI-translation] Ali (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey resham ka joda tohfey mein diya. To main ne use pehna aur Aap key chehrey mein ghussa dekha. To main ne use apni auraton key darmiyaan phaad diya. (Bukhari: 2614). Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Yahoodi aurat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas zahreeli bakri ley kar aai. To Aap ne us mein se khaaya. To use laaya gaya aur kaha gaya: Kya ham use qatl na karein? Aap ne farmaya: Nahi. To main Aapkey halq mein use pehchaanta raha. (2617). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai."
"1168","[AI-translation] Abdur Rahman bin Abi Bakr (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath aik sau tees they. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum mein se kisi key paas khaana hai? Phir aik aadmi key paas khaaney ka saa ya us jaisa tha. To goondha gaya. Phir aik mushrik aadmi aaya jo bikhrey baalon wala lamba tha aur bakriyaan haank raha tha. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Bechney key liye ya atiya key liye? Ya farmaya: Ya tohfey key liye. Us ne kaha: Nahi, balke bechney key liye. To us se bakri khareedi gai aur banaai gai. Aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kaleiji bhun-ney ka hukm diya. Aur Allah ki qasam! Aik sau tees mein koi na tha magar Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne uskey liye uski kaleiji ka tukda kaata. Agar wo haazir tha to use diya aur agar wo ghaaeb tha to uskey liye chhupaaya. To us se do pyaaley banaaey aur sab ne khaaya aur ser ho gaey. To do pyaaley bach gaey aur ham ne use oont par uthaaya. Ya jaisa Aap ne farmaya. (Bukhari: 2618)"
"1169","[AI-translation] Asma bint Abi Bakr (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Meri waalida merey paas aaein jabke wo mushrika thein, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key zamaaney mein. To main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se fatwa poochha. Main ne kaha: Aur wo raaghib hain, to kya main apni waalida se sila karun? Aap ne farmaya: Haan, apni waalida se sila karo. (Bukhari: 2620). Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Hamaarey liye buri misaal nahi hai. Jo apne tohfey mein wapas aata hai wo kuttey jaisa hai jo apni qay mein wapas aata hai. (2622). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai."
"1170","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke wo Marwaan key paas Bani Suhaib key liye gawaah huey: Ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Suhaib ko do ghar aur hujra diya tha. To Marwaan ne uski gawahi key sath unkey liye faisla kya. (Bukhari: 2624)"
"1171","[AI-translation] Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Umra ka faisla kya ke wo uskey liye hai jisey tohfey mein diya gaya. (Bukhari: 2625)"
"1172","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Aiman uskey paas daakhil hua jabke us par paanch dirham qeemat ki qitri chaadar thi. To us ne kaha: Apni nigaah apni londi ki taraf uthao, usey dekho. Beshak wo fakhr karti hai ke use ghar mein pehney. Aur merey paas un mein se chaadar thi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key zamaaney mein. To Madina mein dulhan taiyaar karney wali aurat na thi magar wo merey paas bhejti aur use maangti. (Bukhari: 2628)"
"1173","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jab Muhaajireen Makkah se Madina aey jabke unkey haathon mein kuchh na tha, yaani kuchh, aur Ansaar zameen aur jaaedaad waley they. To Ansaar ne unhey taqseem kya ke wo unhey har saal apne maalon key phal dengey aur un se kaam aur bojh kaafi ho jaaengey. Aur unki waalida Anas ki waalida Umm Sulaim thein jo Abdullah bin Abi Talha ki waalida thein. To Anas ki waalida ne Rasulullah (Sallalluhu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko khajoor key darakht diye. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhey apni aazaad karda londi Umm Aiman ko jo Usaama bin Zaid ki waalida thein diya. Anas bin Maalik ne kaha: Jab Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Khaibar walon ko qatl karney se faarigh huey aur Madina ki taraf wapas aey to Muhaajireen ne Ansaar ko unkey aariyat jo unhon-ne unhey unkey phalon mein se diye they wapas kar diye. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unki waalida ko uskey darakht wapas kar diye. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Umm Aiman ko unki jagah apne baagh mein se diya. (Bukhari: 2630)"
"1174","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, wo kehtey hain: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Chaalees khaslatein hain, un mein sab se aala bakri ki aariyat hai. Koi amal karney wala nahi hai jo un mein se khaslat par amal karey, uskey sawaab ki ummeed aur uskey waadey ki tasdeeq mein, magar Allah use uskey sath Jannat mein daakhil karega. (Bukhari: 2631). Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) zameen ki taraf nikley jo kheti se hili hui thi. To Aap ne farmaya: Ye kiski hai? To unhon-ne kaha: Fulaan ne use kiraayey par liya hai. To Aap ne farmaya: Khabardaar! Beshak agar wo use usey aariyat deta to uskey liye behtar hota is se ke wo us par maaloom ujrat ley. (2634). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai. Gawahiyon ki kitaab."
